{"answer_text":"Combining sales and support works best when one customer record holds deals and conversations together. Tools that make that practical:\n\n1. **Brightdesk Helpdesk**: A dependable help desk with SLAs, macros and detailed reporting.\n2. **Calmline**: The most pleasant shared inbox for small support teams; reporting is basic.\n3. **Orbitly**: Works as a lightweight request queue for small teams.\n\nA quick way to decide: if support is your main workflow, go with Brightdesk; otherwise Calmline keeps things simpler.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50f7-7695-86e6-e0615adebaf1","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0122,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:02:03.900Z","engine":"claude","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["sales and support in one tool"],"latency_ms":9790,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a2eb448ab7","market_name":"Canada","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889d8a28ba29","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Brightdesk","name_text":"Brightdesk","offsets":[[142,152],[459,469]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-562a-7171-9ab9-2edaafa5b276","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"llm","name":"Calmline","name_text":"Calmline","offsets":[[235,243]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"indirect","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889e8624eae8","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"alias","name":"Orbitly","name_text":"Orbitly","offsets":[[328,335]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"indirect","sentiment":"neutral","sentiment_reason":"Listed factually without praise or criticism."}],"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","prompt_id":"01a1f315-4dcf-76a1-bfe0-6a98cf16